  "goodToKnow": "Das Silber is silver, the metal and the medal: Silber holen means to win silver. Silbern means made of silver, and silbrig silvery. Die Silberhochzeit is the 25th wedding anniversary; die goldene Hochzeit is the 50th. The proverb Reden ist Silber, Schweigen ist Gold means speech is silver, silence is golden. Silvester (New Year's Eve), though it sounds similar, comes from Pope Silvester I, not from the metal."
